<odoo>
    <template id="credit_application_landing_page" name="Credit Application">
        <t t-call="website.layout"><div id="wrap" class="mouser-page">
            <t t-call="mouser_theme.mouser_common_header"/>
            <main class="credit-landing-shell">
                <section class="net-terms-hero">
                    <div class="net-title">Apply for a Mouser Business NET Terms<br/>Account</div>
                    <div class="net-badge">APPLY for<br/><strong>NET Terms</strong></div>
                    <div class="net-line"></div>
                    <p>For your convenience, Mouser has NET Terms options available for businesses, schools and government agencies.</p>
                    <h2>How does this benefit my company?</h2>
                    <ul><li>Order today, pay within established terms</li><li>Multiple buyers can purchase on your company's NET Terms Account</li><li>Ability to pay multiple invoices, within terms, by submitting one payment for all invoices</li></ul>
                    <h2>How to Apply</h2>
                    <p>After you've completed the required credit application and submitted it online, we will quickly process your request. In most cases, we can approve your credit line the same day. If approved, you will receive an email with your credit limit and payment terms.</p>
                    <a class="mouser-blue-btn" href="/creditapplication/ApplicationForCredit">Apply Online Now</a>
                </section>
            </main>
            <a class="live-chat" href="#"><i class="fa fa-comment"></i> Live Chat</a>
        </div></t>
    </template>

    <template id="credit_application_form_page" name="Credit Application Form">
        <t t-call="website.layout"><div id="wrap" class="mouser-page">
            <t t-call="mouser_theme.mouser_common_header"/>
            <main class="credit-form-shell">
                <h1>Credit Application</h1>
                <p>Complete the form below to apply for a Net Terms account with Mouser Electronics. Please contact <a href="mailto:asia.credit@mouser.com">asia.credit@mouser.com</a> for any questions or assistance.</p>
                <form class="credit-form-box">
                    <h2>Company Information</h2>
                    <div class="form-two"><div><h3>Billing Address</h3></div><div><h3>Delivery Address</h3></div></div>
                    <div class="form-grid">
                        <label>Company Name *<input/></label><label>Website Address<input placeholder="www.company.com"/></label><label>Is your delivery address the same as the billing address?<select><option>Yes</option><option>No</option></select></label>
                        <label>Country *<select><option>India</option></select></label><label>Address Line 1 *<input/></label><label>Address Line 2<input/></label>
                        <label>City *<input/></label><label>State *<select><option>Choose State</option></select></label><label>Postal Code *<input/></label>
                        <label>Account Number (If known)<input/></label><label>Phone *<input/></label><label>Fax<input/></label><label>Email Address *<input/></label>
                        <label>Director(s) *<input/></label><label>Parent/Subsidiary/Branch<select><option>Parent</option></select></label><label>A/P Contact(s) *<input/></label><label>A/P Email Address *<input/></label>
                        <label>Duns (D&amp;B) Number<input/></label><label>Company Registration Number<input/></label><label>Tax Status<select><option>Taxable</option></select></label><label>Tax ID<input/></label><label>VAT Number<input/></label><label>VAT Country<input/></label>
                    </div>
                    <h2>Trade References (3 Trade References Preferred)</h2>
                    <div class="reference-block"><h3>Reference 1 (Required) *</h3><div class="form-grid"><label>Company Name *<input/></label><label>Country *<select><option>India</option></select></label><label>Address Line 1 *<input/></label><label>Address Line 2<input/></label><label>City *<input/></label><label>State *<select><option>Choose State</option></select></label><label>Postal Code *<input/></label><label>Account Number (If known)<input/></label><label>Phone *<input/></label><label>Fax<input/></label><label>Email Address *<input/></label></div></div>
                    <div class="reference-block"><h3>Reference 2 (Recommended)</h3><div class="form-grid"><label>Company Name<input/></label><label>Country<select><option>India</option></select></label><label>Address Line 1<input/></label><label>Address Line 2<input/></label><label>City<input/></label><label>State<select><option>Choose State</option></select></label><label>Postal Code<input/></label><label>Account Number (If known)<input/></label><label>Phone<input/></label><label>Fax<input/></label><label>Email Address<input/></label></div><button type="button" class="mouser-blue-btn small">Add Reference (Optional)</button></div>
                    <h2>Authorisation</h2>
                    <p><label class="auth-check"><input type="checkbox"/> By submitting this application, I am authorising a Credit Review and release of banking and/or financial information. I also acknowledge that terms of payment are Credit Card or Prepaid until net terms are approved. Each invoice will be subject to a 1.5% charge per month if not paid according to approved account terms.</label></p>
                    <p>Credit reports and Account information: the credit of your business will be used in making credit decisions. You authorise us to investigate the creditworthiness of your business by obtaining credit reports and making other inquiries.</p>
                    <p>If you would like to find out more about how Mouser handles your personal data, please refer to our <a href="/privacypolicy/">Privacy Centre</a> for more information.</p>
                    <button class="submit-btn" type="button">Submit</button>
                </form>
            </main>
            <t t-call="mouser_theme.mouser_common_footer"/>
            <a class="live-chat" href="#"><i class="fa fa-comment"></i> Live Chat</a>
        </div></t>
    </template>

    <template id="privacy_policy_page" name="Privacy Centre">
